&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;CLEAR is building THE secure identity company of the future. Our mission is to make experiences safer and easier—physically and digitally. With more than 43 million Members and a growing network of partners across the world, CLEAR&#39;s secure identity platform is transforming the way people live, work, and travel. Whether it’s at the airport, stadium, or throughout your everyday life, CLEAR unlocks the magic of frictionless experiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Business Development Representative to help grow CLEAR’s Healthcare business by building pipeline and creating qualified opportunities with healthcare organizations and prospective partners. You’ll combine thoughtful prospecting, compelling storytelling, and curiosity about our customers to introduce healthcare leaders to CLEAR’s identity solutions and help make healthcare experiences safer and easier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own pipeline generation across inbound and outbound channels, consistently creating high-quality opportunities for CLEAR’s Healthcare business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect and engage healthcare decision-makers through strategic, personalized outreach across email, phone, social selling, and other channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand prospective customers, their needs, their challenges, and the healthcare landscape to clearly articulate how CLEAR’s identity solutions can create value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales and Account Executives to qualify prospects, uncover opportunities, and build pipeline that converts into revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing, Sales, and Product to sharpen messaging and go-to-market strategies, using data and insights to continuously improve outreach, conversion, and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you&#39;ll measure success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified healthcare pipeline generated and influenced against quarterly targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achievement of outbound activity, response, meeting conversion, and opportunity generation targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue contribution from sourced opportunities, including pipeline quality, velocity, and conversion to closed-won business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated expertise in CLEAR’s identity solutions, target customers, and the healthcare landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;re great at:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building relationships through excellent written, verbal, and listening skills, with the ability to understand customer needs and communicate a compelling value proposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership of your goals with a self-starter mindset, persistence, curiosity, and a bias for action in a fast-paced, evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using data and a process-oriented approach to understand performance, identify opportunities, and continuously improve prospecting and outbound strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging sales technologies such as Salesforce, Outreach, ZoomInfo, and LinkedIn Sales Navigator to research prospects, personalize outreach, and build pipeline effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing AI and emerging technologies thoughtfully to strengthen prospect research, personalize outreach, identify opportunities, and improve productivity while maintaining a high bar for quality and judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You&#39;ll be Rewarded:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CLEAR, we help YOU move forward - because when you’re at your best, we’re at our best. You’ll work with talented team members motivated by our mission of making experiences safer and easier. Our offices are bright and energetic with an open concept and plenty of conference rooms and casual co-working spaces. We also offer catered lunches every day and have fully stocked kitchens. Outside of the office, we invest in your well-being and learning &amp;amp; development with stipends and reimbursement programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer holistic total rewards, including comprehensive healthcare plans, family-building benefits (fertility and adoption/surrogacy support), flexible time off, annual wellness stipend, free OneMedical memberships for you and your dependents, a CLEAR Plus membership, and a 401(k) retirement plan with employer match. The on-target compensation range for this role is $70,000 - $120,000, depending on levels of skills and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The on target earning range represents the low and high end of CLEAR’s range for this position. OTE will vary depending on various factors which include, but are not limited to location, education, skills, experience and performance. The range listed is just one component of CLEAR’s total compensation package for employees and other rewards may include annual bonuses, commission, Restricted Stock Units.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status or other characteristics protected by law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;CLEAR provides reasonable accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities or protected needs. Please let us know if you require a reasonable accommodation to apply for a job or perform your job. Examples of reasonable accommodation include, but are not limited to, time off, extra breaks, making a change to the application process or work procedures, policy exceptions, providing documents in an alternative format, live captioning or using a sign language interpreter, or using specialized equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are committed to a transparent and secure hiring process. All communications related to this role will come directly from a CLEAR employee through valid CLEAR channels (e.g., a valid @clearme.com email address or verified CLEAR LinkedIn profile). We encourage candidates to remain alert to job scams and to report any suspicious activity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;CLEAR is building THE secure identity company of the future. Our mission is to make experiences safer and easier—physically and digitally. With more than 43 million Members and a growing network of partners across the world, CLEAR&#39;s secure identity platform is transforming the way people live, work, and travel. Whether it’s at the airport, stadium, or throughout your everyday life, CLEAR unlocks the magic of frictionless experiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.clearme.com/about-us&quot;&gt;CLEAR&lt;/a&gt; for a paid Fall internship (20 hours per week) where you’ll work directly with the VP, Corporate Memberships to help identify and grow strategic partnerships that drive the expansion of CLEAR+. You’ll gain hands-on experience in partnerships, sales, business development, and commercial strategy while contributing to high-impact projects across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Corporate Memberships team in identifying and researching new partnership and corporate membership opportunities that drive growth for CLEAR+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research prospective companies across the travel ecosystem and key decision-makers using tools like LinkedIn Sales Navigator, ZoomInfo, and other business resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with outbound business development efforts, account prioritization, and pipeline management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop presentations, partnership proposals, and sales collateral for prospective and existing partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support special projects that improve sales processes, CRM workflows, and partnership operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help prepare for industry events and conferences through research, logistics, and lead generation activities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in an MBA or other master&#39;s program, or recently graduated with a bachelor&#39;s degree (Spring/Summer 2026) or graduating with a bachelor&#39;s degree in December 2026, in Business, Marketing, Economics, Hospitality, Finance, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in exploring a career in partnerships, business development, strategy, sales, or the travel industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about how strategic partnerships drive business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with excellent attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized, proactive, and excited to contribute in a fast-paced, collaborative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;re great at:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting research and identifying new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesizing market and account insights into actionable recommendations, both verbally and in writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing multiple tasks and deadlines with a proactive and organized approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working collaboratively with cross-functional teams to drive results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortably using AI tools to improve research and productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging tools like Excel, Google Workspace, CRM platforms (Salesforce or HubSpot), or other business applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You&#39;ll be Rewarded:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CLEAR, we help YOU move forward - because when you’re at your best, we’re at our best. You’ll work with talented team members motivated by our mission of making experiences safer and easier. Our offices are bright and energetic with an open concept and plenty of conference rooms and casual co-working spaces. We also offer catered lunches every day and have fully stocked kitchens.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hourly pay for this role is $25 per hour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status or other characteristics protected by law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
