&lt;p data-start=&quot;928&quot; data-end=&quot;1160&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate combines strong technical leadership with a deep understanding of consumer product development, building high-performing teams that move quickly while maintaining quality, reliability, and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
