&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vmr5j9&quot; data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1335&quot;&gt;Lead and grow multiple engineering teams responsible for CLEAR&#39;s consumer experiences across mobile, web, marketing technology, and Concierge products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12tmv3e&quot; data-start=&quot;1336&quot; data-end=&quot;1503&quot;&gt;Define and execute the technical strategy for customer-facing applications, ensuring scalable, reliable, and performant experiences that delight millions of members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i5vl9v&quot; data-start=&quot;1504&quot; data-end=&quot;1689&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Product, Design, Marketing, and Business stakeholders to prioritize roadmaps that improve acquisition, conversion, engagement, retention, and member satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14hsst4&quot; data-start=&quot;1690&quot; data-end=&quot;1835&quot;&gt;Drive engineering excellence by establishing best practices around architecture, delivery, quality, observability, and operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1oiy2e5&quot; data-start=&quot;1836&quot; data-end=&quot;2019&quot;&gt;Build highly collaborative relationships across Engineering, Product, Design, Data, and Marketing to rapidly deliver customer value through experimentation and continuous iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fjdkke&quot; data-start=&quot;2020&quot; data-end=&quot;2155&quot;&gt;Champion modern engineering practices, enabling teams to move quickly while maintaining reliability, security, and technical quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;viam44&quot; data-start=&quot;2156&quot; data-end=&quot;2293&quot;&gt;Develop engineering managers and senior engineers, fostering a culture of ownership, innovation, accountability, and continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qs0bb0&quot; data-start=&quot;2294&quot; data-end=&quot;2432&quot;&gt;Use data, experimentation, and customer insights to inform technical investments and continuously improve the digital member experience.&lt;/li&gt;
