&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nac5hr&quot; data-start=&quot;2460&quot; data-end=&quot;2596&quot;&gt;12+ years of software engineering experience, including 6+ years leading engineering teams and 3+ years managing engineering managers.&lt;/li&gt;
