&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;CLEAR is building THE secure identity company of the future. Our mission is to make experiences safer and easier—physically and digitally. With more than 43 million Members and a growing network of partners across the world, CLEAR&#39;s secure identity platform is transforming the way people live, work, and travel. Whether it’s at the airport, stadium, or throughout your everyday life, CLEAR unlocks the magic of frictionless experiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a strategically-minded, technology-focused, and customer-centric software development leader to lead one of our digital engineering teams. This team powers CLEAR’s digital experience, enabling seamless, intuitive support for members and travelers in the moments that matter most. As an Engineering Leader, you will lead a team responsible for building the tools, systems, and platforms that support real-time, in-person experiences across airports and beyond. Your work will directly impact how Ambassadors assist members from identity verification to personalized service ensuring every interaction is fast, intuitive, and exceptional.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A successful candidate will bring strong software development experience, be an effective communicator, and have the ability to lead programs from inception through delivery. You thrive in fast-paced environments and are motivated by building reliable, scalable systems that power human-centered experiences. This individual will have a track record of delivering well-architected, highly-available platforms that enable both operational excellence and rapid innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
