&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and operate a scalable, secure, and highly available cloud platform infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive automation across infrastructure provisioning, deployment, and operations to improve efficiency and reduce manual overhead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and enforce best practices for system reliability, observability, incident response, and disaster recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering teams to improve deployment pipelines, service operability, and production readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership, making clear architectural decisions and communicating trade-offs, risks, and impacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own operational excellence through metrics, SLAs/SLOs, and continuous improvement of system performance, reliability, and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;re great at:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience managing and developing software engineers, with strong coaching and team leadership skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with CI/CD systems, infrastructure automation, and release engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of cloud platforms (e.g., AWS) and distributed systems architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Infrastructure as Code (e.g., Terraform, Pulumi)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Kubernetes and container orchestration at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for high availability, fault tolerance, and operational resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one modern programming language (e.g., Python, and or Java) and solid software engineering fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability tooling (monitoring, logging, tracing) and incident management practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate cross-functionally and influence teams to adopt infrastructure and operational best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal, communication, and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, proactive, and committed to continuous learning and improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
