&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;CLEAR is building THE secure identity company of the future. Our mission is to make experiences safer and easier—physically and digitally. With more than 43 million Members and a growing network of partners across the world, CLEAR&#39;s secure identity platform is transforming the way people live, work, and travel. Whether it’s at the airport, stadium, or throughout your everyday life, CLEAR unlocks the magic of frictionless experiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Product Lead to lead the evolution of our identity and evidence platform powering both CLEAR Travel and &lt;a href=&quot;https://identity.clearme.com/&quot;&gt;CLEAR1&lt;/a&gt;. This role is responsible for evolving the systems that establish, maintain, and leverage high-integrity identity across consumer and enterprise experiences—enabling seamless, secure interactions wherever CLEAR operates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the Identity Verification Platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the strategy and roadmap for CLEAR’s identity and evidence platform across consumer (CLEAR+) and enterprise (CLEAR1) products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable proofing, verification, and evidence services that power all CLEAR surfaces (mobile, web, airport, partner integrations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advance Identity Assurance &amp;amp; Evidence Systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand and optimize source verification to improve assurance, reduce cost, and increase coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how identity is established (proofing) vs. continuously evaluated (signals), and evolve both layers over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment with National Institute of Standards and Technology frameworks (e.g., IAL2/IAL3) while maintaining flexibility for real-world use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build a Scalable, Reusable Identity Layer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decouple identity from individual products—ensuring identity can be created once and leveraged across multiple experiences and relying parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop systems for evidence storage, re-use, and auditability to support network-level advantages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure interoperability with emerging standards (e.g., mDoc / ISO 18013-7)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optimize Cost, Performance, and Resiliency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive down cost per proofing/verification through orchestration, vendor strategy, and intelligent fallback systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve success rates and reduce false negatives/positives across all identity flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build resiliency into critical identity services to support high-scale, real-time environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own Data Integrity, Observability, and Compliance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat data integrity and traceability as first-class requirements across all identity systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reporting, alerting, and audit tooling across all assurance layers and dependencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure systems are proactively compliant with regulatory and audit requirements—not reactive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive Cross-Platform Experiences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure seamless interoperability between airport, mobile, web, and partner experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and eliminate friction across enrollment, verification, account management, and recovery flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable new identity-powered experiences across CLEAR+ and CLEAR1 ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead Cross-Functional Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering, design, operations, legal/compliance, and external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex identity and regulatory requirements into clear product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment across teams and hold stakeholders accountable to outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operate as a Domain Leader&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an internal expert on identity, proofing, and verification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of industry trends (fraud, deepfakes, synthetic identity, standards evolution)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously identify opportunities to strengthen CLEAR’s identity moat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’re great at:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of product management experience, preferably in identity, fintech, security, or highly regulated environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency across backend systems, APIs, and distributed architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of identity proofing, authentication, and fraud systems (e.g., document verification, biometrics, device intelligence, data corroboration)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with standards such as NIST 800-63 or equivalent assurance frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills—ability to decompose ambiguity and identify root causes quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to define and execute multi-quarter strategies across complex systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of cost structures and ability to drive meaningful efficiency improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relentless focus on measurement—defines success through clear metrics and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance customer experience, security, compliance, and business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills in a highly cross-functional environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership mentality—operates with urgency, accountability, and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
