&lt;p&gt;You will serve as a key partner to B2B leadership, driving operational rigor, scalable infrastructure, and data-driven decision-making to accelerate revenue growth. You will define the roadmap for revenue systems, lead cross-functional initiatives, and build the foundation for long-term scale.&lt;/p&gt;
