&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Reduction in data integrity issues related to patient matching and identity resolution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
