&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills, including working alongside HIM teams and external vendor support to resolve integration challenges&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Articulating technical concepts to a mixed audience of technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborating and mentoring less experienced members of the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
